{"content_hash": "5e0dcaf12da31b58", "version_id": 577, "article_id": 58, "level_code": "ja_n4", "lang": "ja", "level": 2, "level_label": "N4 初級", "title": "ニコン、AIで作った動画を失格に 科学写真コンテスト", "title_zh": "尼康取消AI生成视频的获奖资格，科学摄影比赛出事了", "has_translation": true, "topic": "tech", "source": "bbc_tech", "source_url": "https://www.bbc.co.uk/news/articles/cr86z33pdy9vo?at_medium=RSS&at_campaign=rss", "image": {"type": "photo", "url": "https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1614036417651-efe5912149d8?ixid=M3wxMDk3Mzk1fDB8MXxzZWFyY2h8MXx8cHJpemUlMjB3aW5uaW5nJTIwaW1hZ2V8ZW58MHwwfHx8MTc5MTc2NTYxNXww&ixlib=rb-4.1.0&w=1600&q=75&fm=jpg&fit=max", "provider": "unsplash", "credit": "Photo by Brands&People on Unsplash", "author": "Brands&People", "credit_url": "https://unsplash.com/@brandsandpeople?utm_source=daily-english-news&utm_medium=referral", "source": "Unsplash", "source_url": "https://unsplash.com/photos/yellow-paper-award-ribbon-ZdqSuxl3Lak?utm_source=daily-english-news&utm_medium=referral", "fallback": {"type": "gradient", "from": "hsl(16, 42%, 62%)", "to": "hsl(54, 46%, 48%)", "label": "TECH", "seed": "cec84960fed8"}}, "published_date": "2026-10-12", "word_count": 136, "reading_minutes": 0.4, "lead": "ニコンが開く科学写真のコンテストで、優勝した動画がAIで作られたものだと分かりました。ニコンはこの動画を失格にしました。", "lead_zh": "尼康举办的科学摄影比赛中，获奖视频被发现是用AI制作的。尼康取消了它的获奖资格。", "preview": "ニコンは毎年、顕微鏡で撮った写真と動画のコンテストを開いています。今年の優勝は中国の清華大学のニン・シュー博士の動画でした。子どもがかかる病気、PCDの気道で、細い毛のような「繊毛」が動く様子を写したものです。", "preview_zh": "尼康每年举办显微镜照片和视频比赛。今年的冠军是中国清华大学宁旭博士的视频。视频拍摄的是一个患病儿童PCD的气道中，像细毛一样的“纤毛”在动。", "has_audio": true, "audio": {"id": 565, "url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/audio/58/ja_n4.mp3", "duration": 29.638, "size_bytes": 181584, "engine": "edge-tts", "voice": "ja-JP-NanamiNeural", "word_count": 94, "has_timeline": true}, "detail_url": "https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/chjam12301-sys/news-etl@870ce8b/content/data/versions/577.json", "paragraphs": ["ニコンは毎年、顕微鏡で撮った写真と動画のコンテストを開いています。今年の優勝は中国の清華大学のニン・シュー博士の動画でした。子どもがかかる病気、PCDの気道で、細い毛のような「繊毛」が動く様子を写したものです。", "しかし、多くの科学者が「この動画は本物ではない」と言いました。AIを使ったと分かったからです。"], "paragraphs_zh": ["尼康每年举办显微镜照片和视频比赛。今年的冠军是中国清华大学宁旭博士的视频。视频拍摄的是一个患病儿童PCD的气道中，像细毛一样的“纤毛”在动。", "但是，很多科学家说“这个视频不是真的”。因为发现使用了AI。尼康调查后宣布，使用AI违反了比赛规则。"], "body": "ニコンは毎年、顕微鏡で撮った写真と動画のコンテストを開いています。今年の優勝は中国の清華大学のニン・シュー博士の動画でした。子どもがかかる病気、PCDの気道で、細い毛のような「繊毛」が動く様子を写したものです。\n\nしかし、多くの科学者が「この動画は本物ではない」と言いました。AIを使ったと分かったからです。", "body_zh": "尼康每年举办显微镜照片和视频比赛。今年的冠军是中国清华大学宁旭博士的视频。视频拍摄的是一个患病儿童PCD的气道中，像细毛一样的“纤毛”在动。\n\n但是，很多科学家说“这个视频不是真的”。因为发现使用了AI。尼康调查后宣布，使用AI违反了比赛规则。", "text": "ニコンは毎年、顕微鏡で撮った写真と動画のコンテストを開いています。今年の優勝は中国の清華大学のニン・シュー博士の動画でした。子どもがかかる病気、PCDの気道で、細い毛のような「繊毛」が動く様子を写したものです。 しかし、多くの科学者が「この動画は本物ではない」と言いました。AIを使ったと分かったからです。", "vocab": [{"word": "コンテスト", "pos": "noun", "zh": "比赛", "note": "外来语，常用", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "優勝", "pos": "noun", "zh": "冠军", "note": "", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "動画", "pos": "noun", "zh": "视频", "note": "", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "失格", "pos": "noun", "zh": "取消资格", "note": "", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "科学者", "pos": "noun", "zh": "科学家", "note": "", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "本物", "pos": "noun", "zh": "真的，真货", "note": "", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "ルール", "pos": "noun", "zh": "规则", "note": "外来语", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "反する", "pos": "verb", "zh": "违反", "note": "常与“ルール”搭配", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "認める", "pos": "verb", "zh": "承认", "note": "", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "見直す", "pos": "verb", "zh": "重新审视，修改", "note": "", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}], "title_original": "Prize-winning image which sparked backlash was AI-generated, Nikon rules", "summary_original": "The camera-maker says it is now re-evaluating the rules and procedures of its Small World in Motion contest.", "body_original": "Prize-winning image which sparked backlash was AI-generated, Nikon rules\nBy\nZoe Kleinman\nTechnology & AI editor\nPublished\n9 October 2026\nThe winner of a prestigious scientific photography competition has been disqualified following concerns raised by other scientists that it was fake.\nNikon said the use of generative AI in the composition of the video broke the rules of its Small World In Motion contest, which accepts photos and video taken using powerful microscopes.\nThe firm said the video \"did not comply with the competition rules regarding generative AI\", but added it was not a judgement of the entrant's professional reputation or scientific contributions.\nIt said it would now look at the rules and procedures of the annual contest, which has been running for 15 years and is specifically for microscopic images.\nNikon said it came to the decision \"after thoroughly re-evaluating the video and supporting materials and consulting with members of our judging panel\".\nThe winning entry came from Dr Ning Xu, from Tsinghua University in China, who submitted a short video showing tiny, hair-like structures called cilia moving in the airway of a child with the respiratory condition PCD.\nThe BBC has approached him for comment.\nA number of scientists, including former competition judges, complained to Nikon on its LinkedIn page that the video did not appear to be real.\nXu had acknowledged using AI, but said he believed he had acted within the rules, and had cooperated with Nikon's investigation.\nUniversity of Leicester scientist Dr Robert Hirst, who was among the first experts to voice concerns, said he was \"not surprised\" and he \"knew immediately that the video was fabricated\".\n\"I have been diagnosing PCD for 20 years by examining their cilia waveform, length, cell size and shape,\" he said.\nHirst, who is lead scientist for the NHS centre for PCD diagnosis at the university, said the cells and cilia \"look nothing like those from PCD patients\".\n\"This controversy has impacted a lot of patients, scientists, doctors and PCD support networks around the world,\" he said.\nTiny image sparks big backlash in Nikon photo contest\nPublished\n1 October\nWhat is AI, how does it work and why are some people concerned about it?\nPublished\n14 September\nSign up for our Tech Decoded newsletter\nto follow the world's top tech stories and trends.\nOutside the UK? Sign up here\n.\nRelated topics\nArtificial intelligence\nPhotography\nScience & Environment", "fetched_at": "2026-10-12T00:40:13.616651", "timeline": [{"i": 0, "w": "ニコン", "s": 0.125, "e": 0.55, "sm": 125, "em": 550, "cs": 0, "ce": 3, "si": 0}, {"i": 1, "w": "は", "s": 0.562, "e": 0.713, "sm": 562, "em": 712, "cs": 3, "ce": 4, "si": 0}, {"i": 2, "w": "毎年", "s": 0.725, "e": 1.387, "sm": 725, "em": 1387, "cs": 4, "ce": 6, "si": 0}, {"i": 3, "w": "、", "s": 1.387, "e": 1.712, "sm": 1387, "em": 1712, "cs": 6, "ce": 7, "si": 0}, {"i": 4, "w": "顕微鏡", "s": 1.712, "e": 2.325, "sm": 1712, "em": 2325, "cs": 7, "ce": 10, "si": 0}, {"i": 5, "w": "で", "s": 2.337, "e": 2.438, "sm": 2337, "em": 2437, "cs": 10, "ce": 11, "si": 0}, {"i": 6, "w": "撮っ", "s": 2.45, "e": 2.663, "sm": 2450, "em": 2662, "cs": 11, "ce": 13, "si": 0}, {"i": 7, "w": "た", "s": 2.675, "e": 2.775, "sm": 2675, "em": 2775, "cs": 13, "ce": 14, "si": 0}, {"i": 8, "w": "写真", "s": 2.788, "e": 3.188, "sm": 2787, "em": 3187, "cs": 14, "ce": 16, "si": 0}, {"i": 9, "w": "と", "s": 3.2, "e": 3.4, "sm": 3200, "em": 3400, "cs": 16, "ce": 17, "si": 0}, {"i": 10, "w": "動画", "s": 3.425, "e": 3.762, "sm": 3425, "em": 3762, "cs": 17, "ce": 19, "si": 0}, {"i": 11, "w": "の", "s": 3.775, "e": 3.913, "sm": 3775, "em": 3912, "cs": 19, "ce": 20, "si": 0}, {"i": 12, "w": "コンテスト", "s": 3.925, "e": 4.525, "sm": 3925, "em": 4524, "cs": 20, "ce": 25, "si": 0}, {"i": 13, "w": "を", "s": 4.537, "e": 4.6, "sm": 4537, "em": 4600, "cs": 25, "ce": 26, "si": 0}, {"i": 14, "w": "開い", "s": 4.612, "e": 4.987, "sm": 4612, "em": 4987, "cs": 26, "ce": 28, "si": 0}, {"i": 15, "w": "て", "s": 5.0, "e": 5.062, "sm": 5000, "em": 5062, "cs": 28, "ce": 29, "si": 0}, {"i": 16, "w": "い", "s": 5.075, "e": 5.188, "sm": 5075, "em": 5187, "cs": 29, "ce": 30, "si": 0}, {"i":